{"seq":1,"slug":"segmentation-targeting","title":"用户分群与精准推送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/segmentation-targeting","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"用户分群与精准推送\">用户分群与精准推送</h1><p>广播式推送（向全量用户发送同一条消息）的时代早已过去。2025 年行业数据显示，精准分群推送的点击率比全量广播高 40%-70%，而过度推送是用户关闭通知权限的首要原因。分群精准推送的核心问题是：基于什么维度将用户划分为有意义的群组，以及如何在推送平台中高效执行这种定向投递。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>RFM 模型</strong>：基于 Recency（最近活跃）、Frequency（使用频率）、Monetization（付费价值）的用户分层</li>\n<li><strong>FCM Topic</strong>：服务端向已订阅某 topic 的全部设备广播消息的机制</li>\n<li><strong>Condition 表达式</strong>：FCM 支持的多 topic 逻辑组合（AND/OR/NOT，最多 5 个 topic）</li>\n<li><strong>位图（Bitmap）圈选</strong>：使用 RoaringBitmap 对千万级用户做毫秒级集合运算的分群技术</li>\n<li><strong>频率控制（Frequency Capping）</strong>：限制每用户单位时间内收到的推送条数，防止用户疲劳</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分群维度体系\">分群维度体系</h2><p>用户分群不是一维标签，而是多维属性的组合。有效的分群体系需要覆盖四个层面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度层面</th>\n<th>典型属性</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础属性</td>\n<td>地域、语言、时区、OS/设备型号</td>\n<td>注册信息 + 设备上报</td>\n<td>低频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行为特征</td>\n<td>最近活跃时间、使用频率、功能偏好</td>\n<td>埋点数据</td>\n<td>实时/日更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td>新用户/活跃/沉默/流失/回归</td>\n<td>计算模型</td>\n<td>日更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务标签</td>\n<td>付费等级、兴趣类别、订阅状态</td>\n<td>业务系统</td>\n<td>事件驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"行为分群的-rfm-模型\">行为分群的 RFM 模型</h3><p>借用零售行业的 RFM（Recency, Frequency, Monetary）模型，移动推送场景改造为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>R (Recency)</strong>：最近一次打开 app / 点击通知的时间距今天数</li>\n<li><strong>F (Frequency)</strong>：过去 30 天的 app 启动次数 / 通知交互次数</li>\n<li><strong>M (Monetization)</strong>：累计付费金额 / 过去 30 天订单数</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RFM Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RFM Score} = w_R \\times R_{score} + w_F \\times F_{score} + w_M \\times M_{score}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RFM Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>各分值通常按五分位划分（1-5 分），权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 根据业务目标调整。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[全量用户] --&gt; B{R &gt; 30天?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[沉默/流失用户群]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{F &gt; 10次/月?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[高活跃用户群]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{M &gt; 0?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[低频付费用户群]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[低活跃免费用户群]&#10;    C --&gt; I[推送策略: 召回/唤醒]&#10;    E --&gt; J[推送策略: 低频高质量]&#10;    G --&gt; K[推送策略: 复购引导]&#10;    H --&gt; L[推送策略: 价值教育]\">graph TD\n    A[全量用户] --&gt; B{R &gt; 30天?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[沉默/流失用户群]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{F &gt; 10次/月?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[高活跃用户群]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{M &gt; 0?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[低频付费用户群]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[低活跃免费用户群]\n    C --&gt; I[推送策略: 召回/唤醒]\n    E --&gt; J[推送策略: 低频高质量]\n    G --&gt; K[推送策略: 复购引导]\n    H --&gt; L[推送策略: 价值教育]</pre><h2 id=\"平台原生定向能力\">平台原生定向能力</h2><h3 id=\"fcm-topic-与-condition\">FCM Topic 与 Condition</h3><p>FCM 提供两种服务端定向机制：</p>\n<p><strong>Topic 订阅</strong>：客户端主动订阅 topic，服务端向 topic 广播：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 客户端订阅&#10;FirebaseMessaging.getInstance().subscribeToTopic(&quot;sports_news&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 客户端订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FirebaseMessaging.getInstance().subscribeToTopic(\"sports_news\")</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// 服务端发送&#10;{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;topic&quot;: &quot;sports_news&quot;,&#10;    &quot;notification&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;比赛结束&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;...&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sports_news\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"notification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"比赛结束\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Condition 表达式</strong>：组合多个 topic 的逻辑关系（最多 5 个 topic，支持 AND/OR/NOT）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;&#39;sports_news&#39; in topics &amp;&amp; !(&#39;muted&#39; in topics)&quot;,&#10;    &quot;notification&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;...&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"'sports_news' in topics &#x26;&#x26; !('muted' in topics)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"notification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Topic 的局限</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扇出延迟：大量订阅者的 topic 可能需要数秒到数分钟完成投递</li>\n<li>粒度粗：不支持基于用户属性的动态计算</li>\n<li>状态管理：服务端无法查询某 topic 的订阅者列表</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"apns-无原生分群\">APNs 无原生分群</h3><p>APNs 不提供 Topic/Condition 等服务端分群机制——每次推送必须指定具体的 Device Token。分群逻辑完全在应用服务端实现：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>业务系统计算目标用户群</li>\n<li>从 Token 数据库查询该群组对应的所有 active Token</li>\n<li>逐一（或批量并发）向 APNs 发送</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"hms-topic-与用户标签\">HMS Topic 与用户标签</h3><p>HMS Push 支持 Topic 订阅（上限 2000 topic/app）和 Tag（标签）定向。Tag 由服务端设置，无需客户端参与：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"POST /v2/{appid}/messages:send&#10;{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;topic&quot;: &quot;promotion_electronics&quot;,&#10;    &quot;notification&quot;: {...}&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>POST /v2/{appid}/messages:send</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"message\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"topic\": \"promotion_electronics\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"notification\": {...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"服务端分群引擎设计\">服务端分群引擎设计</h2><p>生产级推送系统的分群不依赖平台原生能力（太弱），而是在服务端构建独立的分群引擎：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>技术选型示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>用户画像存储</td>\n<td>存储用户属性和行为标签</td>\n<td>Redis (实时标签) + ClickHouse (行为聚合)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分群规则引擎</td>\n<td>定义并执行分群条件</td>\n<td>SQL/DSL 解析 → 位图运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人群圈选</td>\n<td>根据规则输出目标用户 ID 列表</td>\n<td>Bitmap intersection（RoaringBitmap）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 映射</td>\n<td>user_id → active Token</td>\n<td>关系数据库或 KV 存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推送执行</td>\n<td>批量发送到平台网关</td>\n<td>消息队列 + 并发 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"位图-bitmap-圈选方案\">位图（Bitmap）圈选方案</h3><p>当用户量达到千万级时，逐条查询数据库效率极低。使用位图运算可以在毫秒级完成复杂条件的交集/并集/差集计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Segment: &quot;过去7天活跃&quot; AND &quot;iOS用户&quot; AND NOT &quot;已购买高级版&quot;&#10;= bitmap_active_7d &amp; bitmap_ios &amp; ~bitmap_premium_purchased\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Segment: \"过去7天活跃\" AND \"iOS用户\" AND NOT \"已购买高级版\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>= bitmap_active_7d &#x26; bitmap_ios &#x26; ~bitmap_premium_purchased</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RoaringBitmap 对稀疏位图有极好的压缩率，1 亿用户的单个标签位图通常 &lt; 20MB。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动态分群-vs-静态分群\">动态分群 vs 静态分群</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>定义方式</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分群</td>\n<td>人工圈选一批用户 ID</td>\n<td>一次性/手动更新</td>\n<td>活动定向、测试群组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态分群</td>\n<td>规则定义（条件实时计算）</td>\n<td>实时/准实时</td>\n<td>基于行为的自动分群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测分群</td>\n<td>ML 模型输出概率</td>\n<td>日/小时更新</td>\n<td>流失预警、转化预测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>动态分群的优势在于&quot;人群自动流动&quot;——用户行为变化后自动进入或退出分群，无需运营人员手动更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个性化推送内容\">个性化推送内容</h2><p>分群解决了&quot;给谁发&quot;，但同一群组内的个性化程度也会影响效果。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变量模板\">变量模板</h3><p>推送内容中嵌入用户级变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"标题：{{user_name}}，你关注的{{product_name}}降价了&#10;正文：限时特价 ¥{{price}}，比你上次看的便宜了{{discount}}%\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>标题：{{user_name}}，你关注的{{product_name}}降价了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>正文：限时特价 ¥{{price}}，比你上次看的便宜了{{discount}}%</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"推荐引擎驱动\">推荐引擎驱动</h3><p>对于内容型应用（新闻、电商、视频），推送的内容选择由推荐引擎决定——不仅分群发送，还为每个用户选择最佳的推送内容 item：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[推送任务触发] --&gt; B[目标分群圈选]&#10;    B --&gt; C[推荐引擎为每个用户选 Top-1 内容]&#10;    C --&gt; D[模板渲染个性化 payload]&#10;    D --&gt; E[批量推送执行]\">graph LR\n    A[推送任务触发] --&gt; B[目标分群圈选]\n    B --&gt; C[推荐引擎为每个用户选 Top-1 内容]\n    C --&gt; D[模板渲染个性化 payload]\n    D --&gt; E[批量推送执行]</pre><p>这种&quot;千人千面&quot;推送在 2025 年中国市场已成为主流——头部应用的推送 CTR 因此达到 4.8%（vs 规则引擎的 2.7%）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率控制-frequency-capping\">频率控制（Frequency Capping）</h2><p>精准推送必须配合频控——即使消息内容相关，过高频率仍会导致用户疲劳：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>频控维度</th>\n<th>典型规则</th>\n<th>可配置性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局上限</td>\n<td>≤ 3 条/天/用户</td>\n<td>运营可调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道上限</td>\n<td>营销类 ≤ 1 条/天</td>\n<td>分渠道配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时段限制</td>\n<td>22:00-08:00 不推送</td>\n<td>分时区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷却期</td>\n<td>用户点击后 N 小时不再推送同类</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级抢占</td>\n<td>高优先级消息可突破低频控</td>\n<td>按消息类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>频控引擎在推送执行前拦截超限消息，被拦截的消息可以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>直接丢弃（营销类）</li>\n<li>延迟到下一个可用时间窗口（非紧急通知）</li>\n<li>降级到站内信（保证信息可达但不打扰）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>频控数据是 <a href=\"ab-testing-timing\">A/B 测试与推送时机</a> 优化的重要输入——测试不同频率下的 opt-out 率和 LTV 变化，找到最优发送频率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>用户分群是精准推送的基础——从基础属性、行为特征、生命周期和业务标签四个维度构建分群体系，通过位图运算在服务端实现毫秒级大规模圈选。平台原生能力（FCM Topic/HMS Tag）适合粗粒度广播，细粒度精准推送需要自建分群引擎。分群必须配合频率控制，在&quot;相关性&quot;和&quot;打扰度&quot;之间找到平衡点。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"用户分群与精准推送","id":"用户分群与精准推送"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分群维度体系","id":"分群维度体系"},{"level":3,"text":"行为分群的 RFM 模型","id":"行为分群的-rfm-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"平台原生定向能力","id":"平台原生定向能力"},{"level":3,"text":"FCM Topic 与 Condition","id":"fcm-topic-与-condition"},{"level":3,"text":"APNs 无原生分群","id":"apns-无原生分群"},{"level":3,"text":"HMS Topic 与用户标签","id":"hms-topic-与用户标签"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端分群引擎设计","id":"服务端分群引擎设计"},{"level":3,"text":"位图（Bitmap）圈选方案","id":"位图-bitmap-圈选方案"},{"level":2,"text":"动态分群 vs 静态分群","id":"动态分群-vs-静态分群"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化推送内容","id":"个性化推送内容"},{"level":3,"text":"变量模板","id":"变量模板"},{"level":3,"text":"推荐引擎驱动","id":"推荐引擎驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"频率控制（Frequency Capping）","id":"频率控制-frequency-capping"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"降级与多通道策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/delivery-reliability/fallback-multi-channel"},"next":{"title":"A/B 测试与推送时机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/engagement-operations/ab-testing-timing"}}